sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-overall> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Nelson et al. (2017) Development & Kim et al. (2015) Dev. Cell microfluidic transmural pressure, Laplace epithelial wall stress, and ASM peristalsis driving embryonic lung branching — MorphoEval overall 52.6/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2015-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering.py` (weighted score: 54.0/100). The Pass 1 baseline evaluates only a 2-point scalar Hill formula at Delta P = 50 Pa and 200 Pa without a 2D spatial branching airway tree or moving-boundary phase-field solver, omits the common-mode gauge invariance verification across independent (P_lumen, P_pleura) pairs in the microfluidic chest cavity, omits Laplace circumferential wall stress sigma_theta = Delta P * R / h and synchronized Airway Smooth Muscle (ASM) Ca2+ peristaltic wave frequency f_ASM(Delta P), omits nifedipine Ca2+ channel blockade and tracheal drainage (Delta P = 0 Pa) negative controls, and does not load or segment the vendored mouse embryonic lung branching specimen (`embryonic_lung_branching_specimen.jpg`). Overall 52.6/100 (faithfulness 49.7, reproducibility 59.2); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 55, Morphological realism / specimen match 44, Parameter expressivity 50, Morphometric validation 52, Source and data traceability 68, Code-to-model traceability 56, Reproducibility package 54. Output judged: docs/media/tracheal_viscous_fingering_comparison.png: rendered output of 2015-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering.py at 8871db0, image/png, 20665 B, 720×480 px, artifact_sha256 c3caf793f5996b270d1667111ff0738b35c3df7b5e149eae303592fc699a996f (sha256 c3caf793f5996b270d1667111ff0738b35c3df7b5e149eae303592fc699a996f), spec_fingerprint 3ff5590a2e90cba39f3787578e96d03eba17c0eb535c7b4f860a74e9898f90de. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 3ff5590a2e90cba39f3787578e96d03eba17c0eb535c7b4f860a74e9898f90de; artifact_sha256: c3caf793f5996b270d1667111ff0738b35c3df7b5e149eae303592fc699a996f; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/tracheal_viscous_fingering/embryonic_lung_branching_specimen.jpg=8086ebb8b44cbdff..., datasets/tracheal_viscous_fingering/paper_citations.bib=147c24db66fc3582..., datasets/tracheal_viscous_fingering/scout_manifest.json=5ca9d0b7e3b9f2d2..., datasets/tracheal_viscous_fingering/tracheal_viscous_fingering_reference.json=da4d1143ccb80d60...}." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Implement a coupled 2D spatial branching airway tree & luminal pressure / Laplace epithelial hoop stress solver across Delta P in [0, 400] Pa, coupling sigma_theta = Delta P * R / h, synchronized ASM Ca2+ peristaltic wave frequency f_ASM(Delta P), and FGF10/ERK1/2/Etv4 tip bifurcation.",
            "remediation needed: Segment the vendored Mus musculus pseudoglandular embryonic lung branching specimen (`embryonic_lung_branching_specimen.jpg`) to extract distal-to-total area fraction, terminal bud tip count (17 tips), effective bifurcation generations (4.09), and mean distal tip radius (3.85 px), backed by runtime SHA-256 verification and an 8-suite `--self-test`.",
            "remediation needed: Verify exact common-mode gauge invariance across independent microfluidic chest pressure pairs (P_lumen, P_pleura) = (200, 0), (0, -200), (500, 300), and (200, 200) Pa, alongside nifedipine L-type Ca2+ channel ASM blockade and tracheal drainage (Delta P = 0 Pa) negative controls." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.526"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (MorphoEval Autonomous Loop Slot 059 Pass 1 Assessor)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf orcid:0009-0007-4948-9192 ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

